  skos:topConceptOf <https://repository.product-passport.ec.europa.eu/product/batteries/vocabs/battery-error-code>;
  skos:definition "minimalVoltage must be a Decimal and Unit (volt), and an optional Value Range with Unit (celsius) and Observed Characteristic (Temperature). It is a mandatory field. It must occur only 1 time."@en .

